WEBVTT

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.270
We're here.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.570
This is the house, right?

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:56.660
Yeah.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.110
I'll see you later.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.200
Hey, Yujin?

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.160
Are you sure you'll be all right by yourself?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.620
My mom has a soft spot for me.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.170
She won't stay angry for too long.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.380
Should I wait for you here?

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.170
No, it's okay.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.390
You're finally back in Chuncheon;

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:21.930
you might as well take some time to look around again.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:22.710
Okay.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.400
See you.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.170
You better get going.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.060
Yeah.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.300
You should wear these.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.260
I'll be fine.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.510
Wear them; it's cold.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.080
Joonsang?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.590
Joonsang!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.680
Are you feeling okay?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.350
Joonsang!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:56.230
Do you want to see how ugly Yujin used to be when she was little?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.230
She used to be so ugly, didn't she?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.230
You're right.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.360
Look how ugly she is.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.690
It's a picture of my dad.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.960
You remember when we met Sanghyuk's dad, right?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.200
They were all classmates in high school.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.700
Are you all right, Joonsang?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:13.950
Joonsang!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.840
How could you do this?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.840
Do you have any idea how hurt Sanghyuk is by this?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.840
Well, do you?

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:31.640
This is Sanghyuk we're taking about here!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.140
How could you drive a stake through his heart like this?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:40.060
How has he ever wronged you?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.570
Say something.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.190
Sanghyuk...

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.660
hasn't done anything wrong.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.910
Then why?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:56.410
Don't tell me this is because of that Minhyung person.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.250
Is that what it is?

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.580
What is it about him that you like so much?

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.900
Do you like him so much

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.760
that you're willing to abandon your fiancé of ten years

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.670
and disappoint your mother as well?

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.850
Damn it.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.760
For Heaven's sake, tell me!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.890
Tell me why you're doing this!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.480
My god.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.610
Mom,

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:25.610
I...

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.820
I don't love Sanghyuk.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.700
Minhyung is actually Joonsang.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.120
What?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:40.170
Joonsang never died.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.460
B-But how?

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:46.340
For the last ten years,

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:50.760
I haven't forgotten about Joonsang, not even for a single moment.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.970
Even when the sad and painful moments

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:59.390
far outweigh the happy times you've had with him, like now?

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.850
Yujin.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:03.440
Have you never wanted to forget him?

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.980
These things can't be forgotten, no matter how much time goes by.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.570
Once you've engraved someone in your heart, they're there forever.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:19.660
Joonsang's been the only one in my heart.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.450
But I just can't keep lying to Sanghyuk like this. And to myself.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.840
It's just wrong!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.960
It's wrong.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:34.550
Mom...

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.220
Sanghyuk will be here soon.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.480
I called him.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.120
Have you saved any of my clothes or belongings

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.120
from the time of the accident?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.670
There's something I want to return to a friend.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.590
So you really are Joonsang.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.300
You did regain your memories, then.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:17.760
I've left all your belongings in your room, just in case.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:19.930
Did my father...

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.140
look a lot like me?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:30.890
I'm sorry.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.780
I know I said I wouldn't ask about him.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.990
No, I'm the one who should be sorry.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:43.000
I didn't leave even a single photo of him after he passed away, did I?

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.880
The friend that you just mentioned

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.930
is that Yujin girl, isn't it?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.930
How did you know?

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.520
She knew that you were Joonsang.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.290
What?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.640
She asked me not to agitate you

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:11.940
while you were still sick in the hospital.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.110
Yujin did?

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.740
She was really thoughtful.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:21.080
She neither seemed resentful nor upset about the whole situation.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.790
I imagine it was quite difficult for her

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.870
to remain calm and hold herself back like that.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.130
She remembered the Joonsang

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.300
that even I had forgotten and abandoned over the last ten years.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.810
I wouldn't have been able to recover my memories or Joonsang

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:45.100
if it hadn't been for her.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.150
Do you love her?

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.610
"Love" is nowhere close to being enough.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.730
Sanghyuk...

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.940
Don't forgive me.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.000
I heard he recovered his memories.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.550
I'm talking about Joonsang.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.510
Yongguk and Jinsook are still skeptical about it, though.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.470
I really didn't want to find out.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.060
I was there too

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.020
the day you went over to Joonsang's.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.400
So you knew then?

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.440
Why didn't you say anything?

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.240
I really wished I could become Joonsang

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.350
ever since the day I thought he had died ten years ago.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.700
Do you know why? {goes with the JP sub line for the line above}

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.750
I was always by your side,

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.500
but you weren't by mine.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.420
You just kept remembering Joonsang and loving him.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:50.350
I don't regret not telling you that I knew he was Joonsang.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.150
Even if the same thing were to happen again, I wouldn't tell you.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:58.320
I don't want to give you up, even if he really is Joonsang.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.110
Because...

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:06.280
you're my first love, too.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.420
Sanghyuk...

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:35.140
Yujin,

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.860
I'm going to let you go.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:42.610
I don't want you to lose Joonsang yet again.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.990
Heaven will punish me

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:52.330
for hurting you like this.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.620
Don't say that.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.630
I'm not hurt at all,

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.960
but I can't bear the sight of you crying.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.470
Yujin,

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.890
it's funny, isn't it?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.270
Joonsang's trying to remember all he can about you,

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.150
while I'm trying to forget all I can.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.530
Even if I call you late at night or if I come to see you;

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:31.490
even if I were to reach out for you, don't take my hand.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.500
Don't even smile for me, and heaven forbid, don't cry for me.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.080
Could you do that for me?

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.880
Could you help me that way?

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.630
S-Sanghyuk...

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.000
I'm sorry.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.390
I really am.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:54.270
This is the last time I'll make you cry.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:04.320
Sorry I couldn't keep my promise...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.570
to stay by your side forever.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.710
Yujin.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.920
It's pretty.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.480
Yujin?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.470
Sorry, I think I lost the other one.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.150
It looks good on you.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:10.110
Let's never be apart from each other again.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.490
It was so hard waiting for you.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.030
You big baby.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:22.200
Why didn't you say anything if you knew I was Joonsang all along?

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.080
You didn't have to get sick and hung up all by yourself.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.700
We met each other again in the end;

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.840
you didn't die and you came back to me.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.340
That's more than enough for me.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:39.720
What?

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.390
What are you saying?

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.690
I'm sorry, Father.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.230
We're not getting married anymore.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.150
Looks like that girl's got a conscience, after all.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.490
Marriage isn't child's play.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.740
Sanghyuk.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.780
Tell us honestly.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.950
What exactly happened?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.390
What is there to tell?

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.200
That Yujin girl probably just told him that she won't marry him.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:08.130
No, it's not Yujin, it's me.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:15.300
Tell us, Sanghyuk, what is it?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.700
I thought I loved her,

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.310
but I was merely infatuated with her.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:26.100
I've just been lying because I wanted her for myself,

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.690
and I ended up hurting her.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.000
I knew it.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.110
It's because of that man, isn't it?

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.740
The guy who was overseeing the ski resort or something.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:40.030
Is it really because of that guy who looks like Joonsang?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.500
I'm sorry.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.950
I've been lying to you as well, Father.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.000
That man actually <i>is</i> Joonsang.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:48.670
What?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.520
I thought he had died in the accident,

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.130
but he had only lost his memories.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:02.600
I've never even heard the name "Joonsang" before.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:07.890
My son is alive and well,

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.600
just as you saw earlier.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.290
Why are you smiling?

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.500
This reminded me of my Mom and Dad.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.670
They apparently used to walk around like this when they were dating.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.340
They'd just walk?

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:38.200
Yeah.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.440
Neither of them had any money back then,

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:41.550
and they didn't want to go back to their homes,

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:46.010
so they just walked around the neighborhood like this, supposedly.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.770
If you count all the times they walked,

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.810
they probably walked about ten times around the world.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.150
What was your father like?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.030
I remember when I was ten years old.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.740
It was the day of the first snow.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.530
We were walking out on the snowy road at night,

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.300
with me riding on Daddy's back;

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.580
His back was so wide and warm.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:17.920
You still don't remember anything about your father, huh?

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:22.410
You mentioned that you were looking for your father

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.390
and that you'd met him before.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.470
I said that?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.350
That I found and met him?

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.560
I didn't feel anything at first.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.940
I just wanted to find out what kind of person he is

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.780
and how we're alike.

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:43.320
And then?

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.580
He didn't seem to remember me at all.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.540
<i>{fax-0.13\fscx94}I couldn't just sit and watch as those memories kept tormenting him.</i>

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:58.920
My mother said he passed away already.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.800
I couldn't ask about him

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.970
since the memories of my father seemed to...

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.680
hurt her a lot.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:10.930
I must have misunderstood back then. Don't worry about it.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.730
Sounds pretty.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:20.570
Wanna go see?

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:24.950
Mi Hee.

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.200
Call me back as soon as you get this.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.540
It's important. Call me.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.690
Yes, coming.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.270
Who is it?

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.150
Can I help you?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.300
I was hoping I could see your mother;

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.580
is she inside?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.240
Mom!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.620
Someone's here to see you.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.170
Who is it?

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:36.200
Do you solemnly swear to be true in good times and in bad,

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.230
in sickness and in health?

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.980
We so swear.

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:44.530
Do you solemnly swear to accept any child that God bestows upon you

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.860
through good times and bad?

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.320
We so swear.

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.030
Then you may now recite your vows.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.450
They must be rehearsing for a wedding.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:56.040
I'm jealous.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.290
Just hold my hand, will you?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:03.500
Please recite your vows.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:08.510
I, Peter Kim, take you, Regina Han, to be my wife.

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:11.850
As God is my witness, I will love you and honor you all the days of my life.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:16.520
I, Regina Han, take you, Peter Kim, to be my husband.

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:19.770
As God is my witness, I will love you and honor you all the days of my life.

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:24.360
You have now declared your consent before the Church.

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:29.490
Do you know them?

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:31.160
Who are they?

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:32.320
No clue.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.420
You may recite your vows.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.530
As God is my witness,

00:22:43.530 --> 00:22:46.750
I, Hyeonsoo Jung, solemnly swear to love and honor Kyeonghee Kim forever.

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:49.200
As God is my witness,

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:52.430
I, Kyeonghee Kim, solemnly swear to love and honor Hyeonsoo Jung forever.

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.100
Then now I pronounce you man and wife before the eyes of the Lord.

00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:09.240
Thank you.

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.120
Do you know why I'm here?

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.120
I'm not sure.

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.460
Your daughter's name is Yujin Jung, correct?

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:25.670
Yes.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:31.970
Have you heard the name Joonsang Kang before?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.260
Joonsang is my son.
